## Handoff #6 — 2026-03-18
**From:** Backend Engineer + Frontend Engineer
**To:** Tech Lead
**Phase:** Phase 4 Complete — Epic 5: Webhooks Authentication Enhancement

### Completed Deliverables
- [x] DB migrations → `db/migrations/V050__webhook_auth_config.sql`, `V051__migrate_existing_webhook_secrets.sql`, `V052__webhook_deliveries_metrics_columns.sql`
- [x] `WebhookAuthType` enum → `...event/model/WebhookAuthType.java`
- [x] `WebhookAuthConfig` sealed model → `...event/model/WebhookAuthConfig.java`
- [x] `CredentialEncryptionService` (AES-256-GCM) → `...event/service/CredentialEncryptionService.java`
- [x] `WebhookCredentialMigrationService` (startup migration) → `...event/service/WebhookCredentialMigrationService.java`
- [x] Auth injector strategy package (6 injectors + registry) → `...event/delivery/`
- [x] `WebhookMetricsService` + `WebhookMetricsDto` → `...event/service/WebhookMetricsService.java`
- [x] Updated `WebhookEntity`, `WebhookDeliveryEntity`, `WebhookDto`, `CreateWebhookRequest`, `UpdateWebhookRequest`
- [x] Updated `WebhookService`, `WebhookDispatcher`, `WebhookController`, `WebhookRepository`, `WebhookDeliveryRepository`
- [x] `WebhookAuthConfigForm.tsx` (5-type auth form) → `frontend/src/features/webhooks/components/`
- [x] `WebhookRetryConfigForm.tsx` → `frontend/src/features/webhooks/components/`
- [x] `WebhookHealthBadge.tsx` → `frontend/src/features/webhooks/components/`
- [x] `WebhookMetricsTab.tsx` (Recharts, 7-day timeline) → `frontend/src/features/webhooks/components/`
- [x] Updated `CreateWebhookModal`, `WebhookSettingsTab`, `WebhookDetailPage`, `WebhookListPage`
- [x] Updated `webhooks.api.ts` (auth + retry + metrics hooks)
- [x] Unit tests: `CredentialEncryptionServiceTest` (8), `WebhookAuthInjectorTest` (5), `WebhookMetricsServiceTest` (3)
- [x] Pre-existing test fixes: `RuleLifecycleConsumerTest`, `SolverServiceTest`, `AuthServiceTest`

### Key Decisions Made
- `DeliveryResult` record gained `boolean permanent` field — credential decrypt errors return `permanent=true`, `OutboxPoller` routes to DLQ immediately without retry
- `WebhookCredentialDecryptionException` simplified to single `(String message, Throwable cause)` + `(String message)` constructors — removed ambiguous `webhookId`-prefixed variant
- `WebhookDeliveryRepository` all 3 metrics queries now include `orgId` parameter for full tenant isolation
- `V052` migration: `org_id` backfilled from `webhooks` table + `NOT NULL` enforced after backfill
- `@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('OWNER', 'EDITOR')")` on `getMetrics()` — `@EnableMethodSecurity` added to `SecurityConfig`
- Auth Edit/Save buttons in `WebhookSettingsTab` gated on `isOwner` (not `!isViewer`) — matches story spec
- `CreateWebhookResponse.secret` → `secretOnCreation` — matches backend `WebhookDto` field name; fixes broken one-time secret copy flow
- `WebhookEntity.toString()` override added — `authConfig` and `secret` excluded

### Open Questions for Next Agent
- [ ] Smoke test Section 3.20 — write tests for webhook auth flow (create with API_KEY, deliver, verify header injected)
- [ ] `WEBHOOK_CREDENTIAL_KEY` env var — document a generated dev key in `scripts/start-local.sh` or `.env.example`
- [ ] `WebhookHealthBadge` fires N parallel metrics requests on list page — consider lazy-loading badges for org with >50 webhooks (minor perf risk, deferred)
- [ ] Signing secret still generated for all auth types (not just `SIGNING_SECRET`) — cosmetic UX cleanup deferred to v2

### Risks / Watch-outs
- `WebhookCredentialMigrationService` runs at startup — if `WEBHOOK_CREDENTIAL_KEY` is missing or <32 bytes, event service fails to start. Default dev key in `application.yml` prevents this locally; ensure prod env var is set before deploy.
- Story 016 auth injector registry uses Spring auto-discovery (`List<WebhookAuthInjector>`) — adding a new auth type only requires a new `@Component` class.
- V050–V052 migrations must be applied in order; V052 drops and recreates an index from V050 that referenced a non-existent column.
- All pre-existing tests updated: `RuleLifecycleConsumer` refactored to `AuditEventProcessor`, `SolverService` gained `AbTestRouter` dep, `RegisterRequest` gained `organizationName` field — all tests now green.

### Next Agent's Starting Point
Read `docs/stories/story-014` through `story-021` acceptance criteria. Run `./scripts/smoke-test.sh` first to confirm baseline health. Then write Section 3.20 smoke tests for webhook auth flow, generate `release-readiness-webhooks-auth.md`, and log Handoff #7.

