## Handoff #5 — 2026-03-18
**From:** Tech Lead (Epic 5 Stories)
**To:** Backend Engineer + Frontend Engineer (parallel)
**Phase:** Phase 4 Ready — Epic 5: Webhooks Authentication Enhancement

### Completed Deliverables
- [x] Project Brief → `docs/project-brief-webhooks-auth.md`
- [x] PRD → `docs/prd-webhooks-auth.md` (8 stories, RICE scored, MVP + v1 scope)
- [x] Solution Architecture → `docs/architecture/solution-architecture-webhooks-auth.md`
- [x] ADR-007: Credential Encryption → `docs/architecture/adr/ADR-007-webhook-credential-encryption.md`
- [x] ADR-008: Auth Injection Strategy → `docs/architecture/adr/ADR-008-webhook-auth-injection-strategy.md`
- [x] ADR-009: Metrics Storage → `docs/architecture/adr/ADR-009-webhook-metrics-storage.md`
- [x] UI Spec → `docs/ux/ui-spec-webhooks-auth.md`
- [x] Story 014: DB Schema (Backend) → `docs/stories/story-014-webhook-auth-db-schema.md`
- [x] Story 015: CredentialEncryptionService (Backend) → `docs/stories/story-015-webhook-credential-encryption.md`
- [x] Story 016: Auth Injection Strategy (Backend) → `docs/stories/story-016-webhook-auth-injection.md`
- [x] Story 017: API Contract (Backend) → `docs/stories/story-017-webhook-api-contract.md`
- [x] Story 018: Metrics Endpoint (Backend) → `docs/stories/story-018-webhook-metrics-endpoint.md`
- [x] Story 019: Auth Form Frontend → `docs/stories/story-019-webhook-frontend-auth-form.md`
- [x] Story 020: Settings Tab Auth Edit (Frontend) → `docs/stories/story-020-webhook-settings-auth-edit.md`
- [x] Story 021: Metrics UI (Frontend) → `docs/stories/story-021-webhook-metrics-ui.md`

### Key Decisions Made
- AES-256-GCM credential encryption; key from `WEBHOOK_CREDENTIAL_KEY` env var (ADR-007)
- Strategy pattern for auth injection — zero changes to `WebhookDeliveryService` when adding new types (ADR-008)
- On-demand SQL aggregate for metrics — no background job, compound index handles scale (ADR-009)
- OAuth 2.0 + Custom Header deferred to v2 (PO decision; too complex for MVP sprint)
- Backward compat: POST with `secret` (no `authType`) infers `SIGNING_SECRET` — zero breaking changes
- `secret` column NOT dropped in this epic — removed in v2 after transition period

### Sprint Plan
- **Sprint 5.1:** Stories 014, 015, 016, 017, 019 (backend foundation + core auth types + frontend form)
- **Sprint 5.3:** Stories 018, 020, 021 (metrics endpoint + settings edit + metrics UI)

### Open Questions for Next Agent
- [ ] Smoke test Section 3.20 needed — Backend Engineer to add after Stories 016+017 pass
- [ ] `WEBHOOK_CREDENTIAL_KEY` env var value for local dev `.env` file — DevOps/TL to generate and document
- [ ] `date-fns` dependency — Frontend Engineer to confirm it's already in `package.json` before Story 021

### Risks / Watch-outs
- `WebhookCredentialMigrationService` runs at startup — if `WEBHOOK_CREDENTIAL_KEY` is missing, service fails to start. Default dev key in `application.yml` prevents this locally; ensure production env var is set before deploy.
- Story 016 depends on Story 015 — backend engineer must complete them in order.
- Frontend Stories 019 and 020 reuse `WebhookAuthConfigForm` — implement 019 first.

### Next Agent's Starting Point
Backend Engineer: start with Story 014 (schema migration), then 015 (encryption), then 016 (injection), then 017 (API contract).
Frontend Engineer: wait for Story 017 backend to be deployed/stubbed, then implement Story 019 first (auth form in create modal), then 020 (settings tab), then 021 (metrics).

