## Handoff #1 — 2026-03-14
**From:** Tech Lead (Release Review)
**To:** Business Analyst (Epic 2)
**Phase:** Phase 4 Complete — Epic 1: Spaces Page Features

### Completed Deliverables
- [x] `SpaceEntity`, `SpaceDto`, `SpaceService`, `SpaceRepository`, `SpaceController` (backend)
- [x] `SlugUtils` + migration V047 (slug column)
- [x] `SpaceListPage`, `SpaceDetailPage`, `SpaceSettingsPage` (frontend)
- [x] `org.api.ts` space CRUD hooks
- [x] `OrgSettingsPage` wired to org update API
- [x] Smoke test Section 3.16 — all tests pass
- [x] Release readiness → `docs/reviews/release-readiness.md`

### Key Decisions Made
- Slug stored in DB at write time, not computed on-the-fly (ADR-001)
- ruleCount via real-time SQL COUNT JOIN — no denormalization (ADR-002)
- auth-service owns space CRUD (existing code pattern)
- Cascade delete: space deletion blocks if rules exist (warn user)

### Risks / Watch-outs
- Slug regenerated on rename — could break existing bookmarks (accepted for v1)
- UNIQUE(org_id, slug) constraint → 409 on collision

